// Plan (phased) over the periods of a year, by Spending Review group, equals Plan for the same year and group: the
// twelve months of a plan row add up to the published annual figure. FY2017-18 has no calendar, so its phased plan is
// BLANK while its Plan is not.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group],
    "plan", [Plan],
    "phased", [Plan (phased)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group]
